# Empty by design. This specification is public, so its baselineNodeset in
# ../spec.jsonld is the official published nodeset URL, pinned to a release tag,
# and nodeset2owl.py reads it straight from there.
#
# This directory is the fallback location for a nodeset that cannot be named by
# URL -- a private or not-yet-published specification. Nothing lands here today.
*.NodeSet2.xml
